to 3.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480990/extras/ccc31133e7d5e1981c443fa1e366a9ad.poster.avif?t=1745427388\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480990/extras/ccc31133e7d5e1981c443fa1e366a9ad.webm?t=1745427388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1480990/extras/ccc31133e7d5e1981c443fa1e366a9ad.mp4?t=1745427388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
